        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bana ba-Israyeli bakakwiilila Jehova, bakati, Twakubisizya, nkaambo twaleka Leza wesu, alimwi twakomba ba-Baala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.10",
